  {
    "id": "position-option-desc",
    "comment": "Activity description (up to 300 chars, e.g. Position/desc/transaction) in the 400x100 box the original patch's LOM_UI_Plugin_KR forces on every SetActive when it is installed (design value was 400x140): best fit 10-20 lands at ~13px. Restore the 140px height and add 40px of width (the card art 'Back' is 760x360 and ends 56px right of the box, 5px below it) so the same text fits at ~16px; 'always' because the KR prefix re-sets the height on every enable. Keep the resizer's floor but raise it to 14.",
