  {
   "id": "option-menu-text",
   "comment": "OptionMenuDialog choice text: 774x55 inside each 875x87 button (Normal/Hover/Disable copies), Source Han Serif 22, best fit 19-22, Wrap/Truncate, no XUnity resizer. Measured all 2556 Story/O_ strings (1275 are referenced after setmenudialog(menudialogs.Options) in the Lua dump): 2417 fit one line at 22px, 137 fit at 21px (99 of them on two lines), and exactly 2 need three lines at the 19px floor and lose their end: O_8_2_6_5_002 ('...to prepare for a decisive battle.') and O_S0003_02_09_003 ('...I might have to call for help.'). A floor of 16 fits both on two lines (16px and 18px); nothing else moves because best fit starts at 22.",
