  {
   "id": "say-title-size",
   "comment": "Speaker title above the name plate (CharacterTitle/<id>, or PlayerInfo/Title/<n> for the player via '{title}'): Text 500x60 UpperRight, Wrap + Truncate, so one line. CharacterSayDialog gets XUnity's ChangeFontSizeByPercentage(0.7) and renders the title at 25px (28 after a rule reload); ThinkSayDialog has no resizer line and renders it at the FontMap size 36 (40 after a reload). At 36 the player title 'Eldest Disciple of Snow Mountain' (PlayerInfo/Title/7, 542px) wraps and loses 'Mountain' on every one of the player's 2343 thought lines while he holds it; at 40 four NPC titles are cut too ('Former Wulin Alliance [Leader]', 'Soul-Stealer Secluded [Orchid]', 'Flying Heaven Gate [Disciple]', 'Young Swordsman in [White]'). Pin both dialogs to 25 so a title looks the same in speech and in thought; the widest title is 377px at 25.",
   "paths": [
    "/StoryCore/SayDialogs/CharacterSayDialog/Panel/Name/Title",
    "/StoryCore/SayDialogs/ThinkSayDialog/Panel/Name/Title"
   ],
   "onTextChange": true,
   "text": {
    "bestFit": false,
    "fontSize": 25
   }
  },
